<title>BELGIUM: Kredietbank sees &quot;very good&quot; 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank sees &quot;very good&quot; 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Kredietbank NV said on Thursday it expected very good 1996 earnings.</p>
<p>&quot;We are full of confidence that full year results will be very good,&quot; Kredietbank chief executive officer Marcel Cockaerts told a news conference.  </p>
<p>Cockaerts said that because second half 1995 earnings were better than a relatively weak first half, second half 1996 profit would have to be compared to a stronger year-earlier period.</p>
<p>&quot;The first two months of the second half have been satisfying,&quot; Cockaerts said.</p>
<p>Kredietbank said on Thursday that first half 1996 group net profit rose 14.5 percent to 6.69 billion francs, partly because of a 2.74 billion franc jump in income from trading and exchange activities.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
